{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pwqQG7aOLx1792854939.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>阿爾巴尼亞及意大利爆發示威，其中阿爾巴尼亞發生警民衝突。</p><p></p><p>阿爾巴尼亞首都地拉那爆發反政府示威，有放在警方防線前的垃圾桶起火。有示威者拆走路磚，並掟向警員及建築物。警方水炮車射水驅散示威者，警員手持盾牌在車後推進。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PXIubuAvqY1792854951.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>至於在意大利首都羅馬，有數百名極右學生上街，回應一周前米蘭等地示威演變為騷亂一事。他們指示威是神聖的權利，不代表有權毀壞店舖，不滿有人宣稱代表學生，但騎劫真正的訴求並大肆破壞。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rElgFSmoj81792854962.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T17:58:17.357490+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:38:05.835510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T17:55:51.317767+00:00","content_hash":"82ab91e77def329ed28472cf73d0e009c15a4bcd2d458593ac88b31c8bbb39c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}